{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)","modules":[{"name":"IssuingSDKDocs"}],"role":"article"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Sessions","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Embed the Certificate","level":2,"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Fetch a Session Token","anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Perform a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST"},{"type":"text","text":" request to the following endpoint:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"URL:","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Headers:"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Content-Type: application\/json","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body:"}],"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json","code":["{","    \"allowOrigin\": \"https:\/\/www.adyen.com\",","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The required "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roles"},{"type":"text","text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Import the SDK","anchor":"Import-the-SDK","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This gives you access to all public types, including ","type":"text"},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Configuration"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProvisioningSession"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not import "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore"},{"text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"text":"Implement a Token Provider","level":2,"anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the "},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements","text":"Device Testing Requirements","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Release build on a physical device"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator."}]},{"text":"Next Steps","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Next-Steps"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardProvisioningGuide","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/SessionsProvisioningGuide","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/OfflineProvisioningGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — Reveal card details, reveal PIN, change PIN (Work in Progress)"}]}]}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/issuingsdkdocs\/gettingstarted"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs/documentation/IssuingSDKDocs/SessionsProvisioningGuide":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Add payment cards to Apple Wallet using th